WEBVTT

00:06.350 --> 00:18.325
Tender evaluation: slow, inconsistent, and hard to defend.

00:19.025 --> 00:31.000
Evalia reads every bid; people decide every score.

00:31.700 --> 00:36.775
1. Upload: tender documents and every bidder's submission.

00:37.075 --> 00:44.175
Each file is registered by bidder and type before anything is read.

00:44.875 --> 00:52.500
2. Read: the criteria, their weights and every requirement.

00:52.800 --> 01:00.100
Each criterion is traced to its clause and confirmed by the evaluator.

01:00.800 --> 01:10.400
3. Evaluate: technical, commercial, contractual; prices by code.

01:10.700 --> 01:16.675
Every finding quotes its source, checked against the page.

01:16.975 --> 01:22.900
Priced schedules are recomputed line by line.

01:23.600 --> 01:32.025
4. Flag: non-compliance and gaps, with the evidence.

01:32.325 --> 01:37.875
One requirement, every bidder, side by side.

01:38.575 --> 01:43.650
5. Decide: a person decides every finding and score.

01:43.950 --> 01:49.750
On key requirements, the evaluator decides before seeing Evalia's view.

01:50.050 --> 01:54.075
Random blind checks guard against rubber-stamping.

01:54.375 --> 02:02.525
Panel members evaluate independently, by role.

02:03.225 --> 02:09.800
6. Record: every decision, reason and source.

02:10.100 --> 02:15.525
Ready for the award report, the debrief and any challenge.

02:16.225 --> 02:23.750
Tested on four real public evaluations against the panels' scores.
